{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12227070","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12227070","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1222707001:1":{"text":"黄昏总算降临了！我从来没觉得时间这么漫长过。","source_cn":"黄昏总算降临了！我从来没觉得时间这么漫长过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13B5FFFFB1D76156","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1222707002:1":{"text":"终于要开始钓鱼了吗？满满已经迫不及待了！","source_cn":"终于要开始钓鱼了吗？满满已经迫不及待了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AB11878AD89753E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1222707002":{"text":"终于要开始钓鱼了吗？满满已经迫不及待了！","source_cn":"终于要开始钓鱼了吗？满满已经迫不及待了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AB11878AD89753E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222707003:1":{"text":"不用，放心！我这次准备的金币多得能直接打造一条黄金鱼出来，用它们当诱饵，黄金孔雀肯定跑不了！","source_cn":"不用，放心！我这次准备的金币多得能直接打一条黄金鱼出来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51595352AEE0E28C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222707004:1":{"text":"可是，你要怎么把金币做成鱼饵呢？它肯定不能直接挂在鱼钩上。","source_cn":"可是，你要怎么把金币做成鱼饵呢？它肯定不能直接挂在鱼钩上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79799CBD674EE323","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222707005:1":{"text":"哈哈，那你们就瞧好了——","source_cn":"哈哈，那你们就瞧好了——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CE7E9503411C443","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222707006:1":{"text":"——哇啊！你……你怎么把所有金币都扔进河里了？！","source_cn":"——哇啊！你……你怎么把所有金币都扔进河里了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9E743083A223ABC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222707007:1":{"text":"这叫“打窝”——把一大团鱼饵扔进水里，吸引鱼聚集过来。我想，这方法对黄金孔雀应该也有用。","source_cn":"这叫“打窝”——把一大团鱼饵扔进水里，吸引鱼聚集过来。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE0187AA73C133E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222707008:1":{"text":"好了，接下来就是我一展身手的时候了！你们就耐心等待鱼儿上钩吧！","source_cn":"好了，接下来就是我一展身手的时候了！你们就耐心等待鱼儿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE41721A46DF68237","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:13:1222707009:1":{"text":"天色渐渐变黑，约克逊的鱼竿始终没有动静","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD04108B9AAF0FC3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222707010:1":{"text":"真奇怪……黄金孔雀怎么还没出现……","source_cn":"真奇怪……黄金孔雀怎么还没出现……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FE48590CACAA1E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222707011:1":{"text":"既然是“传说中的鱼王”，肯定不会那么容易上钩的。再多一点耐心吧~","source_cn":"既然是“传说中的鱼王”，肯定不会那么容易上钩的。再多一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67E4E439CCB8AC81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222707012:1":{"text":"唉，说的也是……如果那么容易就钓到，我也不用亲自——","source_cn":"唉，说的也是……如果那么容易就钓到，我也不用亲自——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x109E5B406A598885","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222707013:1":{"text":"——鱼漂！鱼漂动了！有鱼上钩了！","source_cn":"——鱼漂！鱼漂动了！有鱼上钩了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24B43E8C95DE21DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"需要我帮你钓吗？","source_cn":"需要我帮你钓吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAE22749CBDBE7D58","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"需要我帮你钓吗？","female":"需要我帮你钓吗？","variant_male_record_index":"67476","variant_female_record_index":"67477","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:约克逊":{"text":"约克逊","source":"约克逊","status":"source"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"满满","source":"满满","status":"source"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":